        <p>CURED 10 YEARS AGO. TEN YEARS AGO, Mr. CLARK said:— "My heal tit o.a ood until the age of seventy, when I as taken with ;agonising pains in the back, a stabbing kind of pain that almost took my breath away. There was a gravelly sediment in the water like brick-dust. "Nothing did me good except Doan's Backaohe Kidney Piils. I felt better after the first box, and soon the backache dis- appeared, and the water became clear and natural." TEN YEARS LATER, Mr. CLARK said :-- -" Although eighty-two years old I feel like fifty or sixty. My health is wonderful. Igo out tor long walks every day, and eat and sleep well. Nothing is so helpful as Doan's Backache Kidney Pills in my old age." CURED 1 WO YEARS AGO. TWO YEARS AGO, Mrs. C. MAIT- LAND said :—"Latterly I have had serious kidney weakness which caused fearful pains in my back, accompanied by dis- ordered excretions km,d sediment. I could</p>
