        <p>"But splendid relief has resulted from Doan's Back- ache Kidney Pills. My kidneys are ealthier, and iscretions more natural. Doan's Pills have been in- deed a comfort and a help." TWO YEARS LATER, Mrs. MAITLAND said :</p>
        <p>Mrs. C. MAiTLANc. "Although eighty- 2. park Road, two years old, I now Hapiesden. LONDON. enjoy good health. (From a photo.) I take good walks, and can get in and out of trams. I still find Doan's Pills the best of kidney medicines."</p>
